{"ticker":"DOMS","symbol":"DOMS","instrumentId":3189159,"name":"Doms Industries","industry":"NSE-Consumer Prod-Specialty","about":"DOMS Industries Ltd. traces its roots back over 40 years to the formation of R.R. Industries by founders Late Shri Rasiklal Amritlal Raveshia and Late Shri Mansukhlal Jamnadas Rajani. The company launched its flagship brand \"DOMS\" in 2005, revolutionizing the Indian stationery and art materials market. A strategic partnership with Italian multinational F.I.L.A. in 2012 expanded its global reach and technological capabilities. DOMS has since acquired several companies, including Pioneer Stationery and ClapJoy Innovations, to diversify its product offerings. With a robust portfolio of stationery and art products, DOMS continues to innovate and expand, becoming a trusted name in the industry.","website":"www.domsindia.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:16:38.885Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":2104.2,"changePct":3.0965213130818134,"week52High":2673.9,"week52Low":1823.5},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹12,770 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,534 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"22,454,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"139"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"20,401,797"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.17%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"10.47"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.5"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"3.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.06"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.86"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"12%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"65.06"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"49–90"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"18.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"41.91"},{"label":"Volume","value":"153,493"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"42,150"},{"label":"Master score","value":"37"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"51"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"45"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"151"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating